WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Oil relief valve spring
What it does: Supplies the force that keeps the relief valve closed until pressure can move it.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Oil relief valve spring
How it works: Pressure moves the plunger against it.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Oil relief valve spring
How it moves: Compresses when pressure displaces the valve and extends as it closes.
